                                        "sense_id": "66a63dd2-4094-37a2-bc43-fb6735c34005",
                                        "entry_id": "bd0ba418-d12c-3025-b111-4d7b596aa85e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A savory dish, of meat or seafood, containing gelatin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "075dbef1-816a-4275-b05b-69276ecc604a",
                                                "sense_id": "66a63dd2-4094-37a2-bc43-fb6735c34005",
                                                "text": "ham mousse"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26fa38c7-8a3a-399f-9fe3-dd77b7e67f70",
                                        "entry_id": "bd0ba418-d12c-3025-b111-4d7b596aa85e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A styling cream used for hair."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fadd99b6-1772-4ee7-8d4c-e00e3fd06d74",
                                                "sense_id": "26fa38c7-8a3a-399f-9fe3-dd77b7e67f70",
                                                "text": "He slicked his hair back with mousse, but the cowlick still stuck up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "790cbbc4-7f49-3d5c-a501-0f9ace4c2c6d",
                                        "entry_id": "bd0ba418-d12c-3025-b111-4d7b596aa85e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stable emulsion of water and oil that is created by wave action churning the water where an oil spill occurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b9c2641-194c-4407-85b0-a4e28fe3673a",
                                                "sense_id": "790cbbc4-7f49-3d5c-a501-0f9ace4c2c6d",
                                                "text": "Pretreatment of oil or sea water with dispersants or demulsifiers generally inhibits laboratory mousse formation with most of the oils and petroleum products tested (Berridge et al. , 1968b; Bridie et al. , 1980a,b)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f884ef6-af2b-4ff1-aaf3-b9540000e340",
                                                "sense_id": "790cbbc4-7f49-3d5c-a501-0f9ace4c2c6d",
                                                "text": "A number of investigators have shown that the starting composition of a parent oil can have a major influence on its predisposittion to form stable water-in-oil emulsions (mousse). For example, the presence of natural surfactants in the wax, resin, and asphaltene fractions of oils has been positively correlated with the tendency to form mousse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d869bc0-0b71-47f7-b7d2-2c30d61815ef",
                                                "sense_id": "790cbbc4-7f49-3d5c-a501-0f9ace4c2c6d",
                                                "text": "When it washed ashore in Prince William Sound, the crude came in sticky gobs, in tar balls, in what they called mousse, crude whipped to a froth in the action of the sea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75d7d42f-52f0-4fa1-8239-76d138d13a74",
                                                "sense_id": "790cbbc4-7f49-3d5c-a501-0f9ace4c2c6d",
                                                "text": "However, the sticky mousse clogged all of the skimmers, even the Vaydaghubsky. If all these skimmers had been on-site during the first three days of calm weather, before the oil was churned into mousse, they could have made a real difference"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mousse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db9269d2-95c1-34d8-a621-f870e4ec5b35",
                                        "entry_id": "6bb61b5c-0074-3d54-9427-d7a09f7db794",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To apply mousse (styling cream)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74a5ca63-7578-43d9-ae8f-c00f4fc96e24",
                                                "sense_id": "db9269d2-95c1-34d8-a621-f870e4ec5b35",
                                                "text": "He moussed his hair in the morning and then washed it out at night."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
